# JNA uses reflection and native lookups. Its AAR does not supply these rules.
# https://github.com/java-native-access/jna/blob/master/www/FrequentlyAskedQuestions.md
# The runtime AAR separately keeps io.ensomi.runtime.** (UniFFI bindings and structures).
-dontwarn java.awt.**
-keep class com.sun.jna.** { *; }
-keep class * extends com.sun.jna.** { *; }
